        ('90030030-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c', 'The delta formed by the Ganga and Brahmaputra rivers, known for Sundari mangrove trees, is:', '{"A":"Mahanadi delta","B":"Sundarbans delta","C":"Godavari delta","D":"Kaveri delta"}'::jsonb, 'B', 'MCQ', 'Social Science', 'Drainage', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Sundarbans delta is the world''s largest and fastest-growing mangrove delta, named after the native Sundari mangrove tree.', 'MEDIUM', true),
